[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316007663","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110746#issuecomment-3316007663","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110746","id":3316007663,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FpkLv","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-21T13:48:55Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T13:48:55Z","body":"CC @deralmas","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316007663/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3325477099","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110746#issuecomment-3325477099","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110746","id":3325477099,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GNsDr","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T20:36:34Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T20:36:34Z","body":"Hi, thank you for your contribution!\r\n\r\nFrom what I can tell looking at this patch, this is disabling fractional scaling, which is not a desirable solution unfortunately.\r\n\r\nThe Wayland ecosystem exposes two scale values: an integer buffer scale, present in the core protocol, and a fractional scale provided by the [fractional-scale-v1](https://wayland.app/protocols/fractional-scale-v1) protocol. Fractional scaling takes priority, while buffer scaling is taken as a fallback. We thus need to support both values to handle cases like 1.75 scaling without blur while preserving compatibility.\r\n\r\nI'm afraid that if there's really an \"accumulation\" issue that it would still happen on scales greater than 2.0, so we need to figure out the root issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3325477099/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3325549310","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110746#issuecomment-3325549310","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110746","id":3325549310,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GN9r-","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T21:05:32Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T21:06:09Z","body":"You're welcome. I didn’t disable it, I just made sure it’s stored and returned when needed. In the editor, we already manage the window size and position manually based on EDSCALE, so storing it is usually enough for Godot to work as expected. I have left it to handle buffer scale changes, but I think there could be inconsistencies if this behavior doesn’t match what other display servers do.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3325549310/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3325708289","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110746#issuecomment-3325708289","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110746","id":3325708289,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GOkgB","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T22:11:56Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T22:11:56Z","body":"I'm afraid that there might be some misunderstanding, sorry. :sweat_smile: \r\n\r\nMost instances of `window_state_get_scale_factor` that you replaced simply scaled appropriately stuff like inputs. Additionally, as far as I remember (been a while), `window_state_update_size` is very important, as it tells the effective buffer to the engine and applies the scale to the window.\r\n\r\nI did a quick test by setting my output scale to 1.25 and disabling any filtering (`output NAME scale_filter nearest` in my sway config) and it indeed looks like fractional scaling is not applied properly:\r\n\r\nBefore this PR:\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"a picture of the godot engine editor\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47a13d06-b172-4b87-a660-6f6776e9408f\" />\r\n\r\nAfter this PR:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"a picture of the godot engine editor, some scaling artifacts can be seen\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be4fdbc7-8f4a-4c80-b68a-504dd11c76f1\" />\r\n\r\nI think that the issue is that we're not compensating for scale on window creation, as the engine stores the \"raw\" size, while the compositor works in \"logical\" values. We're simply giving scaled values to a compositor which expects unscaled values.\r\n\r\nI think it would be easier done than said, although I'm currently very busy. As soon as I find the chance, I can give it a shot if you don't mind.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3325708289/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3746383807","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110746#issuecomment-3746383807","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110746","id":3746383807,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fTUe_","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-13T20:14:18Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T20:14:18Z","body":"Superseded by #113656.\r\n\r\nThank you for your contribution nonetheless!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3746383807/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]